<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47891" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θαργήλια</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερά</span>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ων</span>, τά, a festival of Apollo and Artemis held at Athens in the
		month Thargelion, <i><span class="en">
			Hippon.
			37
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Archil.
			113
		</span></i>, Lex ap.<i><span class="en">
			D.
			21.10
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			22.1138
		</span></i>, etc.:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ταργ-</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			<u>SIG</u>
			57.20
		</span></i> (Milet., <span class="entity">v B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
			<u>Schwyzer</u>
			721.8
		</span></i> (Theb. ad Mycalen, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>): <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θαργηλιών</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῶνος</span>,
			ὁ, name of month at Athens, <i><span class="en">
			Antipho
			6.42
		</span></i>; also at Amorgos, <i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			12(7).62
		</span></i>; and Andros, ib.<i><span class="en">
			135
		</span></i>:—written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ταργ-</span></b>  at Delos, <i><span class="en">
			<u>BCH</u>
			5.26
		</span></i> (but <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θαργ-</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					11(2).287
				</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				19
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>): <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θαργήλιος</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ταργήλιος</span> as pr. n., both in <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				5515
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Iasos</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ταργ-</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Anacr.
				40
			</span></i>.</div>
